# Per-session SDLC state written by the hooks (goal leash, block counters, overrides, nudges).
# The bypass log is the exception: an edit-gate bypass must stay visible, never silent.
.claude/.sdlc-*
!.claude/.sdlc-override-log
# Every worktree goes under .claude/worktrees/ (docs/worktrees.md in the SDLC plugin, SPEC-011): another checkout of this repo, never committed.
.claude/worktrees/
